# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) to override the FE's API base in dev.
#
# Default (no override) points at the prod CFW. For iteration, point at
# the staging worker — same R2 data, separate code — so you don't risk
# prod regressions while iterating.
#
# VITE_RUNS_API_BASE=https://tomat-runs-api-staging.openathena.workers.dev
